<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">copper-dagger</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A dagger of copper, against iron: damage x0.85, speed x1.0, weight x1.05.
Copper is soft: it dents, dulls and gives under a blow, but it is cheap
and easy to work.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 0)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> copper ingot (x1), leather strip (x1)

